  "details": "Currently, when you're with another player in a world, their nameplate theme is static unless you open your menu. This is only a very niche situation where you might see someones nameplate theme be animated, so I don't get to see the animations played all that much. A good compromise would be to let the animation play while a person is speaking\n\nI understand based off others posts that have popped up recently that some may find the animations overstimulating, so I'm fine with this being a setting you can disable/enable.",
